        "created_at": "2014-02-13T17:59:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was just contacted by someone who said that my Matriarch oversized villain card had the wrong text on it.&nbsp; That surprised me because I haven't touched that card in a long time and so haven't had much opportunity to screw it up.&nbsp; But then it occurred to me that perhaps the recent errataing of Rook City has changed her card so that it no longer matches mine.</p><p>Could someone who has the most recent version of Matriarch available post her entire front and back side texts (or maybe PM them to me if posting them here isn't cool) so I can compare them with what I've got when I get home.&nbsp; Maybe I'll need to post a second version for people with a newer Matriarch.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
