        "created_at": "2014-02-13T23:59:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I got my combined IR/RC box in late December.&nbsp; It has her new text, along with regular non-Checmical Explosions and so forth.</p><p>But I think two oversized cards is probably for the best, since you don't want someone buying an old version from their FLGS and then not realizing how fowl-chains work.</p>",
